  associated article.
title: "Code and Data for A Local Structural Basis to Resolve Amorphous Ices"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-12
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/webbtheosim/amorphous-ice"
url: "https://github.com/webbtheosim/amorphous-ice"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for generating descriptors of atomic environments, training an
  interpretable probabilistic classifier, and analysing low-density and
  high-density amorphous ice and their pressure-induced interconversion.
keywords:
  - amorphous ice
  - water
  - molecular simulation
  - structural descriptors
  - probabilistic classification
  - machine learning
  - polyamorphism
